 HISTORY                                                          8347 1451
 -------                                                          8347 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics  8347 1451
 (LEIP) group at North Carolina State University, USA. The        8347 1451
 inelastic scattering thermal scattering law data for uranium     8347 1451
 mononitride (UN) was developed using ab initio lattice dynamics  8347 1451
 methods [1-2]. The Full Law Analysis Scattering System Hub       8347 1451
 (FLASSH) code was used to produce MF=7 and MT=2 and 4 for U in   8347 1451
 UN (U 100% enrichment) [3]. MAT=8347 and ZA=8447 are used for U  8347 1451
 in UN (U 100% enrichment).                                       8347 1451
